- Stablecoins like `KRW-USDT` tend to create “near” candidates without meaningful breakouts for this strategy. You can exclude markets from monitoring/scanning:
-     "excludeMarkets": ["KRW-USDT"]
- ## Aggressive Mode (Option 3)
- Enable aggressive entry/exit behavior:
- - Near-entry before full breakout (default ratio >= 0.99)
- - 5-minute momentum filter (last 3 candles, >=2 bullish)
- - Tight TP/SL (+2% / -2%)
- - Hard take profit (+3%)
- - Trailing stop after +1% (1% drawdown from peak)
- - Max concurrent positions (default 5)
